[size=4][b][color=#FF6A1A]Kilnwarden 0.1.1: hosted access is live[/color][/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Hosted access on [b]<name>.kiln.nexus[/b] and Discord sign-in now work. Needs [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/enshrouded/mods/301][color=#F9C74F]Kiln[/color][/url] 0.2.0-dev.31.10 or later on the server; players need nothing.[/color][/size]
[size=3][color=#F9C74F][b]kiln.nexus is frostdev's own domain for Kiln. It has no affiliation with Nexus Mods (nexusmods.com).[/b][/color][/size]

[list]
[*][size=3][color=#D4D4D8][b]Hosted access is live:[/b] your panel at [b]https://<name>.kiln.nexus[/b] with no port forwarding, for rented game servers, CGNAT, IPv6 only and containers. The relay passes the encrypted traffic through and never decrypts it.[/color][/size][/*]
[*][size=3][color=#D4D4D8][b]Claim pages on claim.kiln.nexus:[/b] Panel settings > Hosted access > [b]Make a claim link[/b] (or the console command [b]kilnwarden claim[/b]) opens [b]https://claim.kiln.nexus[/b], where you claim your name with a Discord account in the Kiln Discord. Links made by 0.1.0 are sent there too.[/color][/size][/*]
[*][size=3][color=#D4D4D8][b]Moves wait 24 hours, with Undo:[/b] moving your name to another server, or releasing it, now waits 24 hours. Until then your panel shows a notice on every page with [b]Undo[/b], and kiln.log and [b]kilnwarden status[/b] say it too. Undo keeps the name on your server and unties it from the Discord account that asked, so someone who gets into your Discord account can't take your name in one go.[/color][/size][/*]
[*][size=3][color=#D4D4D8][b]Discord sign-in works:[/b] this build carries the keys of frostdev.io's sign-in broker. Switch it on in Panel settings > Sign-in, then link Discord in My account.[/color][/size][/*]
[*][size=3][color=#D4D4D8][b]Open web panel:[/b] the Kiln Launcher's button opens Kilnwarden and signs you in with Kiln 0.2.0-dev.31.14 or newer, which is out now. Older launchers don't show it; use the setup link from kiln.log.[/color][/size][/*]
[/list]
[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]What frostdev.io sees and keeps for hosted access and Discord sign-in: [url=https://frostdev.io/kiln/privacy][color=#F9C74F]frostdev.io/kiln/privacy[/color][/url].[/color][/size]

[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Updating from 0.1.0: stop the server, replace [b]kiln/mods/kilnwarden/[/b] with the new zip's folder, and start it. Your accounts, settings, keys and claimed name stay.[/color][/size]

[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]File: kilnwarden-0.1.1.zip, sha256 [b]SHA256-OF-THE-RELEASE-ZIP[/b]. Source and a reproducible build: [url=https://github.com/frostdev-ops/kilnwarden][color=#F9C74F]GitHub[/color][/url].[/color][/size]

[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Bugs and ideas: [url=https://discord.gg/7pjr8SMTfU][color=#F9C74F]Kiln Discord[/color][/url] (#bug-reports) or the Bugs tab, with [b]kiln/logs/kiln.log[/b]. Security problems: privately, please (GitHub's "Report a vulnerability", or a direct message to a moderator on Discord).[/color][/size]
